{"kind":"image","id":"im/y5szq1wz","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":640,"top":32,"width":580,"height":620},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"GabAI project visual"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/c1j91m","slideIndex":0,"text":"0:40 | Imagine needing guidance during an emergency when the internet is unreliable. GabAI is a safety companion designed for Marinduque. It brings preparedness guidance, local emergency contacts and an assistant into one mobile app. Our goal is to make useful information easier to reach before a crisis and during the first moments of one."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/fqj1b5","slideIndex":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/p8fqlsfu","name":"Blank"},"title":"The problem","textShapes":8,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,249,243,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9sjidc7u","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":64,"top":64,"width":1080,"height":80},"text":"The problem","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":43,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#211A18","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m58z2x8j","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":66,"top":150,"width":1050,"height":42},"text":"In an emergency, finding the next step should be simple","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#625954","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/03qh0nqd","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":68,"top":235,"width":600,"height":42},"text":"Information is scattered","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#211A18","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/14zi9s7y","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":68,"top":287,"width":575,"height":96},"text":"People may need to search across messages, websites and contact lists while under pressure.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#625954","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e18zyd87","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":68,"top":416,"width":600,"height":42},"text":"Connectivity can be uncertain","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#211A18","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z2hg7ips","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":68,"top":468,"width":575,"height":96},"text":"A useful safety tool must still provide core guidance when a connection is unavailable.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#625954","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kzuhcr6h","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":64,"top":670,"width":130,"height":22},"text":"GabAI","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#E8590C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l03ilw72","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":1172,"top":670,"width":42,"height":22},"text":"02","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#625954","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/qdkr61sb","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":720,"top":180,"width":480,"height":420},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"GabAI project visual"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/fqj1b5","slideIndex":1,"text":"0:50 | Emergencies create a difficult information problem. People need to know what to do, whom to call and what information to share, often while stressed. That information may be scattered among websites, social media posts and personal contact lists. Connectivity can also be uncertain. Our design challenge is to make essential guidance accessible in a single place, including when the network is unavailable."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/x0rdek","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/p8fqlsfu","name":"Blank"},"title":"The solution","textShapes":9,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,249,243,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cfuxcfid","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":64,"top":64,"width":1080,"height":80},"text":"The solution","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":43,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#211A18","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/belwju1s","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":66,"top":150,"width":1050,"height":42},"text":"An offline-first companion built around local needs","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#625954","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l43ep4zu","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":68,"top":225,"width":590,"height":43},"text":"Guidance at hand","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#211A18","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/03uxgzip","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":68,"top":278,"width":590,"height":75},"text":"Bundled disaster and first-aid guides remain available offline.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#625954","alignment":"left"}}
