{"kind":"image","id":"im/fa9ofet4","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":765,"top":155,"width":360,"height":490},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"GabAI project visual"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x0rdek","slideIndex":2,"text":"0:55 | GabAI brings the core safety journey into one app. Bundled guides cover hazards and first aid, so the guidance can be opened offline. The emergency directory organizes contacts around the user’s location and provides a manual fallback. The screen shown is a product preview. The guide content and hotline directory are drafts and must be reviewed by the appropriate medical and disaster-risk authorities before release."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/ybw4d2","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/p8fqlsfu","name":"Blank"},"title":"A companion that","textShapes":7,"backgroundColor":"rgba(31,21,18,1)"}
