{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dgrm1432","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":68,"top":309,"width":620,"height":100},"text":"The assistant can use cloud AI, an optional on-device model, or bundled guide retrieval.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F1E5DF","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/svilszmh","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":68,"top":449,"width":600,"height":42},"text":"Built for continuity","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#FFAD78","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ru9kzulw","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":68,"top":498,"width":610,"height":95},"text":"When a preferred service fails, GabAI can fall back and tell the user which source answered.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F1E5DF","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qt03qp4b","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":64,"top":670,"width":130,"height":22},"text":"GabAI","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F8B38B","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5s72xk3q","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":1172,"top":670,"width":42,"height":22},"text":"04","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#CAB8AE","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/9kb6t43q","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":770,"top":85,"width":340,"height":555},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"GabAI project visual"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ybw4d2","slideIndex":3,"text":"0:55 | The assistant adds a conversational way to access information. Users can choose cloud AI, a custom backend or an optional model downloaded to a supported device. If the preferred service is unavailable, the app can fall back to an on-device model or bundled guide retrieval, and explains the source of the answer. This is support for navigating information, not a substitute for emergency responders or professional medical care."}
