{"kind":"image","id":"im/xcbqdovq","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":750,"top":195,"width":460,"height":395},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"GabAI project visual"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/uvv01p","slideIndex":4,"text":"0:50 | Our first users are residents and families in Marinduque who want useful safety information close at hand. Local governments, schools and community organizations are potential partners because they already help communities prepare. A focused local pilot gives us a practical way to validate the content, test usability and understand whether people can find the right information quickly. Expansion beyond the pilot would depend on those results."}
