{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/91mnrd","slideIndex":5,"text":"0:55 | We propose keeping essential safety information free to residents. The potential paying customer is an institution such as a local government or community organization that wants to support deployment, outreach and the upkeep of local content. Pilot grants or sponsorships could help fund the initial work. This is a proposed model rather than an existing revenue claim. We would validate willingness to pay, operating costs and procurement requirements with partners before setting a price."}
