{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/t9l1iw","slideIndex":6,"text":"0:55 | Our intended impact is better access to useful safety information and stronger preparedness. We would evaluate the pilot with observed tasks rather than assume that downloads equal impact. Can someone open a guide offline? Can they find an appropriate contact? Do they understand where an answer came from? We would record completion, time to find information and user feedback, then use the findings to improve the product. These are proposed measures, not results already achieved."}
