{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gud6im","slideIndex":7,"text":"0:50 | GabAI has a working foundation, and our next step is a responsible pilot in Marinduque. We are looking for partners who can review the safety content and contact directory, help us test with residents, and support a pilot. The immediate outcome we seek is evidence: whether the app is usable, trusted and helpful in local conditions. We invite you to help us validate GabAI with the community and build the path to a responsible release."}